
# QA Automation DevOps Pipeline

## Overview

A containerized REST API and Cypress API testing
framework integrated with a GitHub Actions CI pipeline.

This project demonstrates automated testing,
containerization, Docker Compose orchestration,
and continuous integration.

## Architecture

- Node.js REST API
- Docker application container
- Cypress test container
- Docker Compose networking
- GitHub Actions CI

## Technologies

- Node.js
- Express
- Docker
- Docker Compose
- Cypress
- GitHub Actions

## Application Endpoints

GET /api/health

GET /api/users

## How to Run Locally

### Start the application and tests

```bash
docker compose up --build
```

### Stop containers

```bash
docker compose down
```

### Run tests

```bash
docker compose up --build \
  --abort-on-container-exit \
  --exit-code-from tests
```

## CI/CD

The GitHub Actions workflow:

1. Checks out the repository
2. Builds Docker images
3. Starts the application
4. Runs Cypress API tests
5. Collects logs and test artifacts
6. Cleans up the environment

## Future Improvements

- Publish images to GHCR
- Deploy to AWS
